{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10518","headline":"同李员外贺哥舒大夫破九曲之作 · 高适","name":"同李员外贺哥舒大夫破九曲之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遥传副丞相，昨日破西蕃。\n作气羣山动，扬军大斾翻。\n奇兵邀转战，连孥绝归奔。\n泉喷诸戎血，风驱死虏魂。\n头飞攒万戟，面缚聚辕门。\n鬼哭黄埃暮，天愁白日昏。\n石城与岩险，铁骑皆云屯。\n长策一言决，高踪百代存。\n威棱慑沙漠，忠义感乾坤。\n老将黯无色，儒生安敢论。\n解围凭庙算，止杀报君恩。\n唯有关河渺，苍茫空树墩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10518.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10518","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}